<title>UK: Hambro Insurance to create 130 new jobs.</title>
<headline>Hambro Insurance to create 130 new jobs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Hambro Insurance Services Group Plc said on Thursday it expected to create around 130 new jobs at its Cunningham Select unit.</p>
<p>&quot;We are expecting our headcount to rise by about 15 or 20 percent at our Cunningham Select claims service,&quot; Nick Page, finance director said in a telephone interview.</p>
<p>Page, forecasting a year of progress for Hambro, said the jobs stemmed from Hambro winning a contract from British insurer Royal &amp; Sun Alliance Insurance Group Plc to handle almost all of its household claims.</p>
<p>The contract with Royal &amp; Sun Alliance runs until January 2003.</p>
<p>&quot;We have to build up Cunningham Select to deal with the volumes,&quot; Page said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
